BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:McDowell Mountain Frenzy
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTSTAMP:20261104T184806Z
UID:cba37be934f7c42f6095aba9@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:50 Mile | 50K | 25K | 10 Mile | 5 Mile Explore the best of McD
 owell Mountain Regional Park. Perfect for beginners and experienced runner
 s alike as the trails wind and weave through beautiful desert single track
